{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GTejYmH582LQcdLRmuNgBV","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context filesystem, here's what I found about KAFKA-20565:\\\\n\\\\n## What is KAFKA-20565?\\\\n\\\\n**KAFKA-20565** is a bug in the Apache Kafka project: a **flaky test issue** for `testAutoCommitSentBeforePositionUpdate` that was experiencing intermittent timeout failures. The test had recently been enabled for the async consumer, and was believed to be related to async consumer changes.\\\\n\\\\n## Timeline\\\\n\\\\n- **Resolution Set**: 2026-05-20T01:18:03Z (May 20, 2026)\\\\n- **PR Merged**: 2026-05-20T01:17:58Z (May 20, 2026)\\\\n  - PR #22256: \\\\\\\"KAFKA-20565: Fix flaky test testAutoCommitSentBeforePositionUpdate timeout\\\\\\\"\\\\n  - Commit: 159d696005eeddc6eb386aa9f50caa7d2b1a9147\\\\n  - Fixed Version: 4.4.0\\\\n\\\\nThe fix involved reverting the test parameterization to the CLASSIC protocol only, as the prepareRebalance stage was affecting async consumer protocol RPCs.\\\\n\\\\n**Sources**: \\\\n- `/store/issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-position-update.md`\\\\n- `/store/issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-test.md`\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-position-update.md\\\",\\\"issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-test.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":12.95,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":4,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":49645,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":6719,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.024189500000000003,\\\"input_tokens\\\":42,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1149}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"20e9080f-0d72-42f2-ab5b-f6a1030f6559","uuid":"f1b26f8b-0abc-4549-83b3-f837e6ee1867","timestamp":"2026-09-27T12:34:35.953Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context filesystem, here's what I found about KAFKA-20565:\\\\n\\\\n## What is KAFKA-20565?\\\\n\\\\n**KAFKA-20565** is a bug in the Apache Kafka project: a **flaky test issue** for `testAutoCommitSentBeforePositionUpdate` that was experiencing intermittent timeout failures. The test had recently been enabled for the async consumer, and was believed to be related to async consumer changes.\\\\n\\\\n## Timeline\\\\n\\\\n- **Resolution Set**: 2026-05-20T01:18:03Z (May 20, 2026)\\\\n- **PR Merged**: 2026-05-20T01:17:58Z (May 20, 2026)\\\\n  - PR #22256: \\\\\\\"KAFKA-20565: Fix flaky test testAutoCommitSentBeforePositionUpdate timeout\\\\\\\"\\\\n  - Commit: 159d696005eeddc6eb386aa9f50caa7d2b1a9147\\\\n  - Fixed Version: 4.4.0\\\\n\\\\nThe fix involved reverting the test parameterization to the CLASSIC protocol only, as the prepareRebalance stage was affecting async consumer protocol RPCs.\\\\n\\\\n**Sources**: \\\\n- `/store/issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-position-update.md`\\\\n- `/store/issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-test.md`\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-position-update.md\\\",\\\"issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-test.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":12.95,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":4,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":49645,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":6719,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.024189500000000003,\\\"input_tokens\\\":42,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1149}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on the context filesystem, here's what I found about KAFKA-20565:\\n\\n## What is KAFKA-20565?\\n\\n**KAFKA-20565** is a bug in the Apache Kafka project: a **flaky test issue** for `testAutoCommitSentBeforePositionUpdate` that was experiencing intermittent timeout failures. The test had recently been enabled for the async consumer, and was believed to be related to async consumer changes.\\n\\n## Timeline\\n\\n- **Resolution Set**: 2026-05-20T01:18:03Z (May 20, 2026)\\n- **PR Merged**: 2026-05-20T01:17:58Z (May 20, 2026)\\n  - PR #22256: \\\"KAFKA-20565: Fix flaky test testAutoCommitSentBeforePositionUpdate timeout\\\"\\n  - Commit: 159d696005eeddc6eb386aa9f50caa7d2b1a9147\\n  - Fixed Version: 4.4.0\\n\\nThe fix involved reverting the test parameterization to the CLASSIC protocol only, as the prepareRebalance stage was affecting async consumer protocol RPCs.\\n\\n**Sources**: \\n- `/store/issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-position-update.md`\\n- `/store/issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-test.md`\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"store\",\"issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-position-update.md\",\"issues/kafka-20565-flaky-autocommit-test.md\"],\"seconds\":12.95,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":4,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":49645,\"cache_write_tokens\":6719,\"cost_usd\":0.024189500000000003,\"input_tokens\":42,\"output_tokens\":1149}}"}}}
